 "title": "Industrial Power Stab",
 "category": "Leads and stabs",
 "text": "Sound: a heavy, distorted power-chord stab: the crunching synth hits that punctuate industrial rock, a root, its fifth and an octave below, pushed through distortion.\n\nHow it's built: three saws on each key: the note, a fifth up (TUNE 7) and an octave down. Mixed, distorted hard with Drive, then the Ladder filter to take the fizz off; a short envelope makes it a hit; a Reverb. Four voices.\n\nPlay: single keys (each is already a power chord), in rhythm.\n\nTweak: DRIVE, the envelope's DECAY, the filter's CUTOFF, the reverb's SIZE.",
